# Run artefacts under examples/**/out/ ARE the deliverables — every generated
# protocol.py, its analysis.json ledger, conformance and signoff — and they are
# small (<1 MB total, no binaries). They are tracked deliberately.
# Only genuinely transient media is excluded:
examples/**/out/**/*.mp4
examples/**/out/**/*.png
.uv/
uv.lock

